Package: konstats
Title: Course Materials for Statistics in Linguistics at the University of Konstanz
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Massimiliano", "Canzi", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "massimiliano.canzi@uni-konstanz.de",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6124-0321"))
Description: Companion package for the Statistics and Advanced Statistics
    courses taught by Massimiliano Canzi at the Department of Linguistics,
    University of Konstanz, written for their students and not meant for
    general use. Installing it brings in the packages of the Statistics
    course; install_course() adds those of Advanced Statistics, and
    check_setup() tests a computer for either course. lectures() lists the
    lectures with their data sets and slides, get_tutorial() copies the
    weekly exercise sheets into a project folder, and an R Markdown template
    starts the weekly assignments. The helper functions written in the
    Advanced Statistics slides are included: residual autocorrelation within
    trajectories, partial dependence, cross-validation by speaker and a
    'ggplot2' theme for papers. The data sets of the courses are in the
    'simling' package.
